| $c{=}35..40$ | $6,15,24,33,42,7$ | $127$ |
| $c{=}41..44$ | $7,16,25,34$ | $82$ |

Horizontal pairs $= 91+97+103+109+115+121+127+82 = 845$.

**Total:** $E = 1150 + 845 = 1995$.

$$\text{Perimeter} = 4 \times 1196 - 2 \times 1995 = 4784 - 3990 = \boxed{794}.$$

**Cross-check via edge-counting:** Vertical exterior edges $= t(0) + \sum_{c=0}^{45}|t(c)-t(c+1)|$ with $t(46)=0$. The differences are: 38 values of $9$, 7 values of $44$ (at $c=4,10,16,22,28,34,40$), and $|43-0|=43$ at $c=45$, summing to $38\cdot9 + 7\cdot44 + 43 = 342+308+43 = 693$. Adding $t(0)=9$ gives $702$ vertical edges. Horizontal exterior edges $= 46$ (top boundary) $+ 46$ (bottom boundary) $= 92$. Total $= 702 + 92 = 794$. ✓

